app/src/main/java/com/android/purebilibili/feature/profile/ProfileBackgroundMotion.kt
/**
 * Compose adapter for Nagram TopView: draw to toolbar + extraHeight and translate
 * the background's origin with avatarY. Nagram uses a peer-color/pattern gradient;
 * BiliPai applies that geometry to its existing wallpaper without changing its crop.
 * Upstream: ProfileActivity.java, 87863c8a, TopView.onDraw / updateExtraViews (GPL-3.0).
 */

