/*
 * Popup platter springs, capsule corner timing, content reveal, return dip and
 * no-anchor shrink reference chen08209/FlClash, lib/ui/popup.dart (main,
 * inspected 2026-10-25).
 * https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash/blob/main/lib/ui/popup.dart
 * FlClash contributors; GPL-3.0. Compose uses the shared Backdrop layer transform
 * for optical sampling. The settings row owns the captured control graphics layer,
 * hides its on-screen replay while the popup is active, and restores it on landing.
 * Menu placement, 160..280dp sizing and neutral menu tints also reference
 * lib/ui/popup.dart and LiquidGlassStyle.menu in lib/ui/liquid_glass.dart.
 * Full license: flclash.LICENSE. Distributed as part of BiliPai under GPLv3.
 */

